eland Legislative Assembly form and notes have been added for tax year 2024 to 2025. The forms from 2020 to 2021 have been removed.","public_timestamp":"2025-04-05T23:15:15Z"},{"note":"The forms and notes have been added for the tax year 2023 to 2024.","public_timestamp":"2024-04-05T23:15:18Z"},{"note":"The forms and notes have been added for the tax year 2022 to 2023.","public_timestamp":"2023-04-05T23:15:19Z"},{"note":"The Northern Ireland Legislative Assembly form and notes have been added for tax year 2021 to 2022. We have removed the form and notes for 2018.\r\n\r\n","public_timestamp":"2022-04-05T23:15:17Z"},{"note":"The Northern Ireland Legislative Assembly form and notes have been added for tax year 2020 to 2021.","public_timestamp":"2021-04-05T23:15:26Z"},{"note":"The Northern Ireland Legislative Assembly form and notes have been added for tax year 2019 to 2020","public_timestamp":"2020-04-05T23:30:03Z"},{"note":"The Northern Ireland Legislative Assembly form and notes have been added for tax year 2018 to 2019.","public_timestamp":"2019-04-05T23:15:50Z"},{"note":"The form and notes have been added for tax year 2017 to 2018.","public_timestamp":"2018-04-05T23:30:20Z"},{"note":"Page has been updated to remove incorrect form and notes for 2017 to 2018. The current form and notes to use are for tax year 2016 to 2017.","public_timestamp":"2018-03-02T16:25:38Z"},{"note":"The form and notes have been added for tax year 2017 to 2018.","public_timestamp":"2018-03-02T15:08:45Z"},{"note":"The form and notes have been added for tax year 2016 to 2017.","public_timestamp":"2017-04-05T23:15:29Z"},{"note":"Rates, allowances and duties have been updated for the tax year 2016 to 2017.","public_timestamp":"2016-04-05T23:30:17Z"},{"note":"The 2015 to 2016 form has been added to this page.","public_timestamp":"2015-04-05T23:30:59Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2014-04-03T23:00:00Z"}],"document_type_label":"Form","documents":["<section data-module=\"ga4-link-t